  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "# Collector history \u2014 Cloudflare Workers Analytics Engine\n\nRun history + health for the **campsite-availability collector** Cloudflare Worker (repo `robot-geographical-society`). Reads the **AE SQL API** (ClickHouse dialect) via the `campsites_ae` ClickHouse datasource. Counts are sampling-weighted (`SUM(_sample_interval)`); there are **61** reservable campsites.\n\n- Cadence + ok/failed/empty of 61: `campsite_collector_runs`\n- Per-agency coverage + step durations: `campsite_collector`\n- Top failing sites: `campsite_collector WHERE blob5='failed'`\n\nPanels read *No data* until the `CF_AE_TOKEN` secret (Account \u2192 Account Analytics \u2192 Read) is set and the nightly collector run emits. Account `d7adee58513c1b2f770ccaac90cf114f`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runs per day",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "query": "SELECT toStartOfDay(timestamp) AS t, SUM(_sample_interval) AS runs FROM campsite_collector_runs WHERE timestamp > now() - INTERVAL '30' DAY GROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "lineWidth": 1
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Sites ok / failed / empty of 61 per run",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "query": "SELECT timestamp AS t, SUM(_sample_interval * double2) / SUM(_sample_interval) AS ok, SUM(_sample_interval * double3) / SUM(_sample_interval) AS failed, SUM(_sample_interval * double4) / SUM(_sample_interval) AS empty FROM campsite_collector_runs WHERE timestamp > now() - INTERVAL '30' DAY GROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 61,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ok"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "failed"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "empty"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Per-agency coverage (sites ok per run)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "query": "SELECT toStartOfDay(timestamp) AS t, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='ok' AND blob2='nps') AS nps, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='ok' AND blob2='usfs') AS usfs, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='ok' AND blob2='wa-state-parks') AS wa_state_parks, SUMIf(_sample_interval, blob5='ok' AND blob2='blm') AS blm FROM campsite_collector WHERE timestamp > now() - INTERVAL '30' DAY GROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Step duration avg / max (ms)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 14,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "query": "SELECT toStartOfDay(timestamp) AS t, SUM(_sample_interval * double2) / SUM(_sample_interval) AS avg_ms, MAX(double2) AS max_ms FROM campsite_collector WHERE timestamp > now() - INTERVAL '30' DAY GROUP BY t ORDER BY t",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "avg_ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "max_ms"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "purple"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        },
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": true,
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "last",
            "max"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top failing sites (last 30d)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
        "uid": "campsites_ae"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "vertamedia-clickhouse-datasource",
            "uid": "campsites_ae"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "meta": {
            "timezone": "UTC"
          },
          "query": "SELECT index1 AS site_id, argMax(blob4, timestamp) AS name, argMax(blob2, timestamp) AS agency, SUM(_sample_interval) AS failures, MAX(timestamp) AS last_failure FROM campsite_collector WHERE timestamp > now() - INTERVAL '30' DAY AND blob5 = 'failed' GROUP BY index1 ORDER BY failures DESC LIMIT 50",
          "extrapolate": false
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "filterable": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
